+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Public review privacy
+
+- [x] 1.1 Narrow the public product-review DTO and mapper to id, rating, description, date, and reviewer first name; verify serialized review responses contain no email, address, customer id, or last name.
+- [x] 1.2 Add focused API/mapper tests for the public review field allowlist; verify the tests fail before and pass after the mapper change.
+
+## 2. Customer submission rules
+
+- [x] 2.1 Validate whole-number ratings from 1 through 5 and authenticated customer ownership before persistence, returning 400 or 403 as specified; verify rejected requests leave no stored review.
+- [x] 2.2 Detect an existing customer/product review and return 409 without creating a duplicate; verify the duplicate integration test and persistence count.
+
+## 3. Merchant moderation and aggregates
+
+- [x] 3.1 Make merchant update/delete resolve reviews within the requested product and return 404 for missing or cross-product reviews; verify both endpoint cases.
+- [x] 3.2 Recalculate product rating and ratingCount after review create, update, and delete using one-decimal HALF_UP rounding and zero values when empty; verify lifecycle tests against GET `/api/v2/product/{sku}`.
+
+## 4. Integration verification
+
+- [x] 4.1 Run the relevant Maven module tests and OpenSpec validation, then fix any regressions; verify the commands complete successfully.
+
+## Workflow follow-up
+
+- Archive the completed OpenSpec change after implementation and verification.
